WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.653
A shared view depends on other database objects This
query uses

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:11.655
information schema metadata to show which tables
feed each view Dependency

00:00:11.682 --> 00:00:17.050
awareness matters because changing a base object or
shared view can affect several downstream consumers

00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:22.488
Before making a breaking change understand the
dependency chain
